{"id":"curitiba","name":"库里奇巴","en":"Curitiba","country":"Brazil","lat":-25.4181,"lng":-49.3219,"dek":"松林间长出的规划之城","history":"1693年，葡萄牙人在此建立定居点，取名“松林之光圣母村”。1721年，地名改为库里奇巴，源自图皮语，意为“多松子之地”。如今城市徽章上的南美杉，仍指向这片高原最初的植被记忆。早期的库里奇巴维持着自给农业与少量矿产活动，直到它成为南里奥格兰德牛群前往圣保罗途中的中间站。牛群经过，带来了牲口贸易与最早的扩张节奏。","culture":"19世纪下半叶，欧洲移民开始成批到来，波兰、意大利、德意志（多为来自俄罗斯的伏尔加德意志人）与乌克兰人构成主要群体。他们带来了不同的语言、节庆和饮食习惯，也塑成了库里奇巴城区深处那些面目清晰的街区。圣塔菲丽西达德至今仍是意大利移民文化的代名词，餐馆与葡萄园分布其间；斯拉夫风味的餐厅集中在旧城区，提供乌克兰式饺子、波兰汤与俄式菜肴。","pull":"马黛茶大亨的豪宅，仍立在旧城高处。","sights":[{"name":"库里奇巴历史中心","orig":"Centro Histórico de Curitiba","intro":"旧城核心保留了不少历史建筑，包括马黛茶时代留下的住宅与公共建筑。周日手工艺市集让历史街区在当代仍有日常性的流动。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/LargodaOrdemCuritiba-1.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"歌剧工厂","orig":"Ópera de Arame","intro":"这座演出建筑以钢架与透明材料围合，架设在前采石场的湖面之上。结构本身如同半完成的工业构架，视觉上却与水面和植被形成意外反差。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/OperaDeArame.WireOperaHouse.CuritibaBrasil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wire_Opera_House"},{"name":"阿拉伯纪念图书馆","orig":"Memorial Árabe","intro":"为致敬中东移民文化而建的专题图书馆，外形近似摩尔式建筑，立方体坐落于水面上，内部有一座作家纪伯伦·哈利勒·纪伯伦的雕像。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Metropolitan_Cathedral_1_Curitiba_Brasil.jpg/960px-Metropolitan_Cathedral_1_Curitiba_Brasil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1283},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landmarks_in_Curitiba"},{"name":"卡庞达因布亚森林与自然历史博物馆","orig":"Bosque Capão da Imbuia / Museu de História Natural","intro":"保留了一片南洋杉林残迹，内部有自然历史展览，展示动物标本与植物标本。架高的“南洋杉小径”穿林而过，用解说窗展示森林物种之间的关联。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Nivaldo_Braga_Museu_Hist%C3%B3ria_Natural.JPG/960px-Nivaldo_Braga_Museu_Hist%C3%B3ria_Natural.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cap%C3%A3o_da_Imbuia_Wood"}],"foods":[{"name":"湿烤地锅饭","orig":"barreado","intro":"巴拉那州沿海地区的传统菜，以牛肉和香料入陶锅长时间炖煮，直至肉烂出胶。传统吃法是浇在木薯粉上，配香蕉和橙片。库里奇巴多家餐厅有供应。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Barreado.jpg/960px-Barreado.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"波兰饺子","orig":"pierogi","intro":"随波兰移民而来的半月形馅饺，常见馅料有马铃薯、乳酪或肉类，可煮或煎，常佐酸奶油或炸洋葱。在库里奇巴旧城区的斯拉夫风味餐厅易于找到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Ruskie.jpg/960px-Ruskie.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":896},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%A2%E8%98%AD%E9%A4%83%E5%AD%90"},{"name":"马黛茶","orig":"chimarrão","intro":"南部巴西日常饮品，将干燥马黛叶末放入葫芦壶，以吸管冲泡。库里奇巴地区靠近传统马黛产区，街头与公园常见人们自带茶具饮用。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Mate_en_calabaza.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1364},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%91%AA%E9%BB%9B%E8%8C%B6"},{"name":"松子","orig":"pinhão","intro":"南美杉的种子，秋冬季节在城市街头常见，通常盐水煮后趁热吃。松子既是巴拉那本土食物记忆的一部分，也与库里奇巴地名的松树意象彼此呼应。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/Pinoli.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":721},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%BE%E5%AD%90"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/ViewCuritiba.BotanicalGarden.Day2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":787},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Bus_Stops_3_curitiba_brasil.jpg/1280px-Bus_Stops_3_curitiba_brasil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":389}],"o